- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/escalation/DuplicateOwnerEmailException.java` (+ `...Handler.java`)

Note: `RequireUniqueOwnerEmail.java` and `RequireUniqueOwnerTelephone.java` exist under `.../function/owner/` but are the older per-field guards; the POST flow now uses the consolidated `RequireUniqueIdentity`.

---

## 2. Owner entity, DTOs, repository

### Entity: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`
JPA `@Entity` on table `owners`. Household/duplicate-relevant persistent fields:
```java
