(`getPostcode`/`setPostcode`, `getEmail`, `getAddress`, `getCity`, `getTelephone`, `namesakeCount` accessors also present. Owner extends `Person` which provides `firstName`/`lastName`.)

### DTOs — generated, defined in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml`
`OwnerFields` schema (request-side fields), lines ~1996–2069, includes:
