Methods: `findByLastName(String)`, `findByLastName(String, Pageable)`, `findById(int)`, `save(Owner)`, `findAll()`, `findAll(Pageable)`, `delete(Owner)`. No household-specific query — all household/duplicate logic scans `findAll()` in the functions above.

